  "review": [
    {
      "section": "time.clock",
      "confidence": "medium",
      "note": "Standard Hindustani system: '{h} بجے', '{h} بج کر پانچ منٹ', 'سوا {h} بجے' (quarter past), 'پونے {next_h} بجے' (quarter to, next hour), '{next_h} بجنے میں دس منٹ' (ten to) for 40/50/55; 35 is additive ('{h} بج کر پینتیس منٹ'). Half past uses '{h} بج کر تیس منٹ', which is correct for every hour but less idiomatic than the usual forms. Schema follow-up (per-hour override): half past is idiomatically 'ساڑھے {h} بجے' for 3-12 but obligatorily 'ڈیڑھ بجے' at 1:30 and 'ڈھائی بجے' at 2:30; 'ساڑھے ایک/دو' is never said, so ساڑھے cannot be used without an override."
    }
  ]
